    "method": "layout_build: vertex-grid painting and hygiene, corner-Wang tile lookup, seeded scatter; collision.rects re-rasterised on the 4 px raster of the blocking set; reachability with the vendored forge_nav (D4) on the bundle's full blocking set (D2: collision.solids and rects, object footprints, the placed tiles' collision), read back as every consumer reads it: footprint validity (r=7, ySquash=0.9) at 4 px grid nodes, 4-neighbour moves with segmentClear and the thin-gap rule, BFS from the first spawn, N14 targets",
